      "title": "Cabinet raises wheat MSP by ₹25 to ₹2,610 per quintal for 2027-28",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/industry/agriculture/cabinet-raises-wheat-msp-by-25-to-2-610-per-quintal-for-2027-28-126093001086_1.html",
      "description": "The MSPs of pulses and oilseeds were increased by higher amounts, ranging between ₹83 and ₹675 per quintal (between 1.41 per cent and 10.32 per cent)",
