    {
      "title": "Cabinet hikes MSP for all rabi crops; safflower gets ₹675 increase",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/cabinet-rabi-msp-2027-28-wheat-safflower-mustard-126093000756_1.html",
      "description": "The Cabinet has approved higher MSPs for all mandated rabi crops for 2027-28, with safflower getting the highest increase of ₹675 per quintal",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-09-30T10:02:35"
